{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26090","headline":"读淮南李相行营至楚州诗 · 鲍溶","name":"读淮南李相行营至楚州诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阃外建牙威不宾，古来戡难忆忠臣。\n已分舟楫归元老，更使熊罴属丈人。\n玄象合教沧海晏，青龙喜应太山春。\n来年二月登封礼，去望台星扈日轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}